  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overcoming Barriers: Supporting the Personal and Professional Development of Displaced Individuals in Costa Rica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the implementation of the actions designed in the project, the beneficiary people, Human Rights defenders, will have the opportunity to access training and academic programs both in Spain and Costa Rica, so that they can continue to promote both their capacities and development of talent, preventing this group&#xB4;s training was paralyzed as a consequence of political events in their countries of origin.</narrative>
  </description>
